Package: talis
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, curl, ca-certificates, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcb-shape0, librsvg2-common
Description: music-aware desktop turntable
 Rendered day and night desktop scenes with rotating artwork, a moving tonearm,
 and MPRIS playback controls. Includes 1080p, 1440p, and 4K scene assets.
 This package targets native X11 desktops. GNOME Wayland requires the separate
 companion extension; this build does not include native Wayland layer-shell.
